	(text_box "1. Do not populate the pull-up resistors for i2c.\n2. JP3 jumper is to select the voltage source for the board.\n3. If the board is powered by 3.3V, place the jumper in the position of 3.3V.\n4. If the board is powered by external source, place the jumper in the position of 3.3VR."
